# Construction Site IoT (Redis)
# Real-time monitoring of safety sensors and equipment.

# 1. Crane Load Sensor (Stream)
# Streaming weight data to detect overload conditions immediately.
XADD sensor:crane:01 * weight_kg 4500 wind_mph 15 angle 45

# 2. Air Quality Monitor (Hash)
# Latest reading for dashboard display.
HSET sensor:air:site_01 pm25 12 pm10 25 co2 450 status "Good"

# 3. Noise Level Alert (Pub/Sub)
# If decibels exceed city ordinance limits, trigger alert.
PUBLISH site:alerts "Noise violation detected at North Gate: 95dB"

# 4. Equipment Geo-Fencing (Geo)
# Ensure heavy machinery stays in designated zones.
GEOADD asset:locations -122.4194 37.7749 "Bulldozer_05"
GEOADD asset:locations -122.4195 37.7750 "Excavator_02"

# Check distance between two assets (Collision warning check)
GEODIST asset:locations "Bulldozer_05" "Excavator_02" m
